FUCC (Fix You, Claude Code) 0.0.2

This Python implementation derives Ubuntu environment management, diagnostics,
and transactional storage from FUCC 0.0.1, a local independent extraction of
CC-Fix 0.2.0-rc.2 plus its Ubuntu adaptation.
CC-Fix upstream: https://github.com/gongyijie85/cc-fix
The upstream copyright and permission notice is retained in LICENSE.

FUCC 0.0.2 replaces the TypeScript implementation and retains FUCC's v1 durable
formats, paths, immutable restoration baseline, and command-line interface.
No Windows backend, GUI, Tauri shell, or Node runtime is included.
Runtime dependencies have their own licenses: jcs (Apache-2.0), wcwidth (MIT).
